# Union Cave (HeartGold's SEQ_GS_D_CHIKATSUURO, the dungeons' theme): a steady, low walk in E minor, a hollow lead
# over a plodding bass and a drip of bells. A cave plays the same by day and night. Original composition for this
# game (plan 20 · J5).
